/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (WATNEY COLLEGE LIMITED IS A PRIVATE LIMITED COMPANY REGISTERED IN ENGLAND AND WALES. WE ARE AN ASIC-ACCREDITED INSTITUTION. THE COLLEGE HAS BEEN DELIVERING REGULATED QUALIFICATIONS SINCE 2022. OUR CAMPUS IS SITUATED IN TOWER HAMLETS, ONE OF LONDON'S MOST VIBRANT AND DIVERSE BOROUGHS, WITHIN WALKING DISTANCE OF ALDGATE EAST AND WHITECHAPEL UNDERGROUND STATIONS. STUDENTS BENEFIT FROM EXCELLENT TRANSPORT LINKS ACROSS LONDON AND THE WIDER UK.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [35]
>>
